      "title": "MilestoneFlow has zero tests despite being a primary CLI command (execute-milestone)",
      "detail": "MilestoneFlow is the only way to re-run a single milestone independently but has no test file. It raises RuntimeError on missing plan — that path is untested.",
      "recommendation": "Add tests/unit/test_milestone_flow.py with mock RunState covering the success and RuntimeError paths."
    },
    {
      "severity": "HIGH",
      "code": "F-002",
      "title": "ReleaseFlow has zero tests; invoked by release-check CLI command",
      "detail": "ReleaseFlow.check() calls ReleaseManagerAgent.check() and writes two artefacts. No unit or integration test exists. Failure modes are unknown in CI.",
      "recommendation": "Add tests/unit/test_release_flow.py. ReleaseManagerAgent is already partially covered by planners_and_reviews tests; mock it there."
    },
    {
      "severity": "HIGH",
      "code": "F-003",
      "title": "ProjectContextFlow has zero tests AND zero docs (generate-context CLI entry orphaned)",
      "detail": "generate-context maps to ProjectContextFlow -> ContextGeneratorAgent. No test exercises the flow end-to-end and no doc page references it.",
      "recommendation": "Add tests/unit/test_project_context_flow.py and a docs/usage.md section for generate-context."
    },
    {
      "severity": "MEDIUM",
      "code": "F-004",
      "title": "InvestigationFlow and BrownfieldDocFlow have zero tests",
      "detail": "Both thin wrapper flows (investigate / document-project) delegate entirely to their respective agents. Agent unit tests exist, but flow wiring is not verified.",
      "recommendation": "Add integration smoke tests using FACTORY_FORCE_MOCK=1; the flows themselves need no mocking beyond the agent layer."
    },
    {
      "severity": "MEDIUM",
      "code": "F-005",
      "title": "5 flows have no CLI entry: CrewFlows, MicroFlow, StepRunner, step_definitions",
      "detail": "IssuePipelineCrewFlow and ProjectDeliveryCrewFlow are alternative implementations with no CLI surface. ProjectDeliveryMicroFlow and StepRunner are only reachable via ReplayFlow --from-step. This means crewai path cannot be exercised by end users without custom Python scripts.",
